xfce4-squeezebox-plugin (1.0.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed GTK3 signal callback signature for style-updated signal
  * squeezebox_style_set had 3 parameters but GTK3 only passes 2,
    causing the sd pointer to be garbage from the stack
  * Added NULL guards in squeezebox_set_size for early signal calls

 -- Hakan Erduman <hakan@erduman.de>  Mon, 17 Feb 2026 18:05:00 +0100

xfce4-squeezebox-plugin (1.0.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed backend symbol export: HAVE_BACKEND_* preprocessor defines were
    not being set in config.h, causing backend_info() symbol to be missing
    from all backend .so files
  * CMakeLists.txt now properly maps ENABLE_* options to HAVE_BACKEND_*
    variables for config.h generation

 -- Hakan Erduman <hakan@erduman.de>  Mon, 17 Feb 2026 17:30:00 +0100

xfce4-squeezebox-plugin (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed plugin API version declaration (X-XFCE-API=2.0)
  * Fixed backend directory path to use absolute path
  * Fixed desktop file installation path
  * Added NULL check for backend directory loading
  * Plugin now loads correctly in XFCE panel

 -- Hakan Erduman <hakan@erduman.de>  Mon, 17 Feb 2026 16:45:00 +0100

xfce4-squeezebox-plugin (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Modernization for XFCE 4.20
  * Migrated from libwnck to libxfce4windowing for Wayland support
  * Ported build system from Autotools to CMake
  * Updated for GTK3
  * Fixed all build warnings and deprecations
  * Updated Debian packaging to debhelper compat 13
  * Updated dependencies for modern XFCE libraries
  * Supports both X11 and Wayland via libxfce4windowing

 -- Hakan Erduman <hakan@erduman.de>  Tue, 17 Feb 2026 16:17:49 +0100

